{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RenderPipelining"}],"title":"RenderPipelining","externalID":"s:6AdaApp16RenderPipeliningV","modules":[{"name":"AdaApp"}],"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RenderPipelining"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AdaApp\/documentation\/AdaApp\/RenderPipelining"},"abstract":[{"text":"Opts a subworld, normally a render world, into pipelined updates.","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaApp\/documentation\/AdaApp\/RenderPipelining\/init(isEnabled:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaApp\/documentation\/AdaApp\/RenderPipelining\/isActive","doc:\/\/AdaApp\/documentation\/AdaApp\/RenderPipelining\/isEnabled"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaApp\/documentation\/AdaApp\/RenderPipelining\/isActive(in:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Methods","title":"Type Methods"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaApp\/documentation\/AdaApp\/RenderPipelining\/Resource-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/Resource","doc:\/\/AdaApp\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/AdaApp\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaApp\/documentation\/AdaApp"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RenderPipelining","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A pipelined subworld runs one frame behind its parent. The parent extracts frame N into it,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"starts its update and continues with frame N+1 without waiting. Before the next extraction the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parent waits for that update to finish, so extraction remains the only point where both worlds","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"meet. Frame time approaches the longer of the two paths instead of their sum, at the cost of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one frame of input latency.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"While a pipelined update is in flight, systems of the subworld must not read the parent world","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(see ","type":"text"},{"code":"Extract","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"MainWorld","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and parent systems must not mutate objects the subworld reads.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"code":"ADAENGINE_PIPELINED_RENDERING=0|1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to override the setting of every world that declares this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"resource, for measurements.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Pipelining is unavailable on WebAssembly, where the setting is ignored.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adaapp\/renderpipelining"]}],"references":{"doc://AdaApp/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaApp\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://AdaApp/documentation/AdaApp/RenderPipelining":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RenderPipelining"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Opts a subworld, normally a render world, into pipelined updates.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RenderPipelining"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaApp\/documentation\/AdaApp\/RenderPipelining","url":"\/documentation\/adaapp\/renderpipelining","title":"RenderPipelining"},"doc://AdaApp/documentation/AdaApp/RenderPipelining/isActive":{"title":"isActive","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaApp\/documentation\/AdaApp\/RenderPipelining\/isActive","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether pipelining is in effect for a world declaring this setting, after the environment override."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isActive"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adaapp\/renderpipelining\/isactive","role":"symbol"},"doc://AdaECS/documentation/AdaECS/Resource":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Resource"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The singleton resource that passed to the ecs world.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Only one instance of the resource is allowed in the world.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Resource"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/Resource","url":"\/documentation\/adaecs\/resource","title":"Resource"},"doc://AdaApp/documentation/AdaApp/RenderPipelining/Resource-Implementations":{"title":"Resource Implementations","kind":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaApp\/documentation\/AdaApp\/RenderPipelining\/Resource-Implementations","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adaapp\/renderpipelining\/resource-implementations","role":"collectionGroup"},"doc://AdaApp/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaApp\/s16SendableMetatypeP","title":"Swi